 "remarks": "Welcome to your new home! Situated in a highly desirable location and available for the first time on the market in over 20 years, this meticulously maintained, quiet, top-floor corner unit condominium offers over 800 square feet of bright, comfortable, and completely turnkey living space. The interior features freshly painted walls throughout, an updated kitchen and bathroom, and a charming fireplace perfect for relaxing evenings. The spacious bedroom comfortably accommodates a king-size bed and boasts two generous closets. High-value upgrades include brand-new windows and a new sliding glass door, alongside the convenience of an in-unit washer/dryer and a dedicated linen closet. This property includes two reserved parking spaces and a private storage unit, all while benefiting from low common charges and low taxes. Located within walking distance to the Merritt 7 train station and just minutes from the Merritt Parkway and I-95, it is a true commuter's dream. Simply unpack, relax, and enjoy this stress-free, maintenance-free oasis!",
